      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In this short scene, agent Sokolov prepares for his surveillance assignment outside Anikeyev's former home. When he asks his partner Anatoly for professional surveillance equipment, he is told that his own two eyes are more than enough. Noticing a bottle on the table, Sokolov realizes what his colleagues plan to do in his absence. Let's listen to their conversation in Russian first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Я прямо сейчас должен идти?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "tolya",
      "t": "Да, Соколов, именно сейчас.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "А что у меня из оборудования?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
