      "t": "Вы будете отдыхать, а я мёрзнуть?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "tolya",
      "t": "Приказ начальника надо выполнять.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "tolya",
      "t": "Иди и действуй, Соколов!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Понял, уже иду наблюдать.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's examine Sokolov's comedic briefing line by line. Sokolov discovers what equipment he gets for surveillance.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Я прямо сейчас должен идти?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Must I go right now?' Sokolov clarifies the timing with a modal adjective.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "tolya",
      "t": "Да, Соколов, именно сейчас.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, Sokolov, right now.' Anatoly confirms the urgency with an emphatic adverb.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "А что у меня из оборудования?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And what equipment do I have?' Sokolov asks about surveillance gear.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "tolya",
      "t": "Твои собственные глаза!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Your own eyes!' Anatoly answers bluntly with a plural noun.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "И это всё моё оборудование?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And is that all my equipment?' Sokolov questions the lack of technology.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "tolya",
      "t": "Этого тебе вполне достаточно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That is quite enough for you.' Anatoly uses a predicative adverb for sufficiency.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "А что это у вас на столе?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And what is that on your table?' Sokolov notices a suspicious bottle.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Вы что, пить алкоголь собрались?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you planning to drink alcohol?' Sokolov asks about their party plans.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "tolya",
      "t": "Ну вот, твои глаза отлично работают!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well look, your eyes work excellently!' Anatoly jokes at the sharpness of his vision.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "tolya",
      "t": "Наблюдательное оборудование в полном порядке.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The surveillance equipment is in full working order.' Anatoly mocks him with official bureaucratic jargon.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Вы будете отдыхать, а я мёрзнуть?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You will relax while I freeze?' Sokolov resents the unfair division of labor.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "tolya",
      "t": "Приказ начальника надо выполнять.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The chief's order must be carried out.' Anatoly cites authority using an infinitive construction.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
